flowchart TD
    A[Sync Request Initiated] --> B[Fetch Data from Google Fit]
    B --> C{Error Occurred?}

    C -- No --> D[Data Stored Successfully]
    D --> E[Sync Complete]

    C -- Yes --> F{Transient or Permanent?}
    F -- Transient --> G[Transient Error]
    F -- Permanent --> H[Permanent Error]

    G --> I[Schedule Retry: Exponential Backoff]
    H --> J[Alert User to Fix Issue]
